+
+s6patch霍尔/README.md records why the BBK hall/elevator drivers are absent from
+this tree, the recovery method (vmlinux-to-elf on the factory Image plus
+per-function disassembly and mechanical extraction of every i2c access), the
+recovered IST8801 register map and data path, the MXM1120 / bbk_hall_core /
+vib_pwm symbol inventory, the userspace interface that has to be matched, and
+the step-by-step plan.
+
+Signed-off-by: Zhiyu722 <Zhiyu722@users.noreply.github.com>
+---
+ s6patch霍尔/README.md | 164 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
+ 1 file changed, 164 insertions(+)
+ create mode 100755 s6patch霍尔/README.md
+
+diff --git a/s6patch霍尔/README.md b/s6patch霍尔/README.md
+new file mode 100755
