++- 写：`vib_pwm_up_down_count_thread`（`0x8aad308`，vib_pwm 线程）`snprintf(buf,49,"%u-%u", vib_pwm_data+672, vib_pwm_data+676)` → `filp_open(...,0x242,0x180)` → `__kernel_write`。
